    "segment": "Requirements definitions are aimed at a business audience, such as clients, customers, and users.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "A requirements definition is a complete listing of everything the customer wants to achieve.The document expresses requirements by describing the entities in the environment in which the proposed system will be installed, and by describing the desired constraints on, monitoring of, or transformations of those entities.",
        "img_id": null
      }
    ],
    "type": null
  },
  {
