        "type": null
    },
    {
        "role": "paragraph",
        "segment": "Integration testing is a team activity that requires coordination in choosing an integration strategy, planning your tests, generating test cases, and running the tests. The integration is planned and coordinated so that when a failure occurs, we have some idea of what caused it. Choosing an integration strategy depends not only on system characteristics, but also on customer expectations, and the goal is to produce a working version early so test and coding can occur concurrently.",
        "citations": [
            {
                "type": "source_text",
                "content": "Integration testing is a team activity, too, and you must coordinate with other team members in choosing an integration strategy, planning your tests, generating test cases, and running the tests.",
