        "segment": "Selected code concept: a simple component where a value X is processed to produce Y, with paths through conditional logic that guarantee different definitions and uses of Y. To satisfy statement testing, we construct test cases that execute every statement at least once and then add tests to exercise multiple definitions and their uses to support all-uses testing.",
        "citations": [
            {
                "type": "source_text",
                "content": "Statement testing: Every statement in the component is executed at least once in some test.",
                "img_id": null
