[
  {
    "role": "paragraph",
    "segment": "Severity data from failure reports can be treated as a measurable input in SEL’s cycle of small experiments and industrial-strength case studies to assess and improve maintenance processes. By analyzing how defects of different severities impact maintenance effort and outcomes, SEL can identify bottlenecks, prioritize improvements, and tailor processes before wider deployment.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "These offline studies were usually performed as formal, controlled experiments or case studies.",
        "img_id": null
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "The SEL usually began with a small experiment, where the size permitted the variables to be controlled easily.Then, when experimental results looked promising, an industrial-strength case study verified that the small-scale results worked in real-world environments.",
        "img_id": null
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "Once the SEL was satisfied that a new technique would be good for NASA's developers and maintainers, it packaged the lessons learned so that others could understand and use the technology.",
        "img_id": null
      }
    ],
    "type": null
  }
]

