    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "Thus, each of the various types of empirical investigations plays a part in learning how various process, product, and resource factors affect software quality.The type and number of studies depend on time, cost, practicality, and necessity. In particular, the more control, the stronger the study.",
